9. What is an object?
An object is an instance of a class.


10. What is inheritance?
Inheritance allows one class to use the properties and methods of another class.


11. What is __init__()?
__init__() is a constructor method that is automatically called when an object is created.


12. What is the difference between == and is?

== checks whether values are equal.

